{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Witt 向量”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Witt向量"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Witt 向量环是 "},{"Local":{"url":"λ-环","text":"λ-环"}},{"Plain":"到环的遗忘函子\n$$\r\nU \\colon \\Lambda\\mathsf {Ring} \\to \\mathsf {Ring}\r\n$$\n的右伴随, 即余自由 Lambda 环.</p>\n"}]}}